    "text": "Or like even when the רבי would say sometimes things very בגילוי, like in the נונ'ס, in all the שיחות in the נונ'ס, they're like, bam, you know, big גילוי, so in a way it's like a big חסד, it's a big revelation, on the other hand it was like a big גבורה because it's like more than, then, you know, it goes out of people's כלים a little bit, and people like it's like it's very hard, it's very harsh, because it's like very shaking of their reality, you know what I mean? Like it's not just these nice, cute, little like, be a good boy שיחות, you know what I mean? You know, because when the רבי says it the way it is, it's like, you know, the world shakes, you know what I mean? It's not like and then what happens is that either people just go like they they don't understand it, and then, you know, they they don't want to understand it, it makes them they don't understand it, because it's like it's totally outside of their world, although they, you know, they go into denial or they go crazy, you know, all kinds of things happen when people learn learn, you know, דבר מלכות שיחות, you know? Because in a way, they're much more גבורה'דיק. They're like crazy, you know, but really the רבי is just saying it straight without making it real בהעלם. So there's all kinds of so with these kind of things, like what you're calling חסד and גבורה is very like it's just a matter of perspective. Yeah. So,",
